  logText: 'December 17th, 2091\n\nAs of today, humanity can finally confirm that
    we are not alone in the universe. The expedition on TRAPPIST-1 e has only just
    began, and it has already turned into the most important one.\n\nA quick internal
    scan of a structure I found revealed a series of complex designs comparable to
    electronic circuits. This was without a doubt built by an advanced species. While
    the interior luckily seems to have been preserved, the structure''s exterior
    suggests that it has been abandoned for a while. '
